text.en:
The Constitution of Universiti Brunei Darussalam (hereinafter Amendment of referred to as "the Constitution") is amended in section 15 -section 1511 ).

(a) in paragraph (b) of subsection (1) by deleting the word "three" and substituting therefor the word "two" ;

(b) by deleting paragraphs (f) and (g) of subsection ( 1) and substituting the following - "(f) such other Permanent Secretaries as His Majesty The Sultan and Yang di-Pertuan may from time to time appoint on the advice of the Vice Chancellor ;

(g) the Mufti Kerajaan ;"

(c) by adding after subsection (5) the following new subsection

(6)- "(6) Whenever the Chairman of the Council desires to obtain the advice of any person touching the affairs of the University, he may invite such person to attend any meeting of the Council for such purpose."
